	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Remitto tibi, chare frater, male com<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>positas lexes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Mirum est virum doctum et regis <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>tanti legatum tam infantiliter et inepte <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>disserere de re omnium maxima.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Sed fortasse ita <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>vult dominus; satis eleganter videntur forte, si modo <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>contegantur auro.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Rogavit a me <persName ref="p3099">Sulcerus</persName> <placeName ref="l28">Basiliensis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>meam de hoc foedere sententiam; quid responderim, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>videbis ex charta inserta, quam re<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>mittes mihi tuto per proximum nuncium, nec <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>aliud adhuc sentio aut sentire possum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Scio <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>aliter habere res apud vos; ut enim maxime te obiicias, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>frustra hoc facies.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Proinde nollem esse <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>author pangendi; monerem, maiorum imitarentur <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>exemplum, qui abhorruerunt a principum foederibus <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>et largitionibus; cum vero hoc videatur frustra <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>dici, nolle tamen te dissimulare, quid tibi videatur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Quodsi illi omnino velint pangere, videant, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>ne quid contra religionem; sed et, quantum quidem <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>fieri possit, ad tuendam evangelicam religionem regem <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>urgeant etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Tu melius nosti, quid hic ab eis possit <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>impetrari, quid non.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Urge, pangant in salutem <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>evangelii et patriae.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Legatus est vir literatus; contuli <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>pauca cum ipso; sed tamen legatus est alieni regis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Des brot ich sing, des lied ich iß; <foreign xml:lang="la">agnoscis proverbium.</foreign></s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Proinde cum huiusmodi hominibus caute agendum puto.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>D. <persName ref="p8075">Erasti</persName> literas, si ullo modo fieri potest, remitte <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>hoc octiduo; quotidie enim expecto nuncium, per <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>quem ad has ei respondeam.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de">Die <placeName ref="l832">Franzosen</placeName> habend <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>zuͦ <placeName ref="l21">Baden</placeName> den 13 orten ouch fürtragen und begärt, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>die einigung zuͦ ernüweren; ist inen kein antwurt <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>worden, sunder die sach in abscheid genommen, hinder <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>sich an ire herren zuͦ bringen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de">H. <persName>Hans Jentzer</persName>, predicant <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>zuͦ <placeName>Erißwyl</placeName>, hat verganges herpsts mitt einem <lb xml:id="p1z34"/><placeName ref="l300">Lucerner</placeName> puren gschlagen.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de">Das ist gericht von <placeName ref="l41">Bernern</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>doch dem predicanten gesagt, er sölle sich vor den <placeName ref="l300">Lucern[ern]</placeName> huͤten.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Darüber ist er in <placeName ref="l300">Lucernerpiet</placeName> gangen, hat inn sin sächer <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>wider anzogen, und alls er ettlich wort ußgstossen, ist <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>er da in rächt gefasset, das er vertröst, wider heim <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>gelassen; doch hat man imm gesagt, er sölle es nitt <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>verstan; hatt nuͤt gehulffen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de">Im rächten so vil funden, <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>das er gen <placeName ref="l300">Lucern</placeName> gfuͤrt; die <placeName ref="l41">Berner</placeName> bricht begärt.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z42"/>Schribend die <placeName ref="l300">Lucerner</placeName> vil wuͤster articklen, die <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>er bekent geredt haben, <foreign xml:lang="la">partim politici, partim ecclesiastici.</foreign></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z44"/>Daruff <placeName ref="l41">Berner</placeName> gen <placeName ref="l300">Luzern</placeName> gesandt <persName ref="p3659">J. Bat Ludwig von Mülinen</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>das best zuͦ handlen.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="de">Was nun ghandlet, weiß ich nitt etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Die <placeName ref="l176">Glarner</placeName> habend jetzund ein nüwen span mitt <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><placeName ref="l2450">Schwytz</placeName>; die habend nitt gewöllen, das sy iren <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>vogt nüwlich erwöllt, <persName>Luchsinger</persName>, uff fuͤrind in das <lb xml:id="p2z4"/><placeName>Gastal</placeName>; dann er sye nitt des allten gloubens.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Scribitur <lb xml:id="p2z5"/><persName>Moronum</persName> cardinalem mitti ad imperatorem pro recipiendo con<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>cilio et exequendo, militem conscribi in agro <placeName ref="l306">Medio<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>lanensi</placeName> et mittendum per Alpes <placeName ref="l2582">Feldkyrchium</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Ego nugas <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>puto; tu si quid certi habes, significa.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale cum omnibus tuis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Salvi sint s<lb xml:id="p2z9"/>ymmystae, consules et viri boni.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="de">12. maii 1564.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Festinantissime.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Praestantissimo viro d. <persName ref="p8009">Ioan<lb xml:id="p2z10"/>ni Fabritio</persName>, <placeName ref="l98">Curiensis</placeName> ecclesiae ministro, domino meo colendo et fratri ac com<lb xml:id="p2z11"/>patri charissimo.</s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l98">Chur</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
